---
layout: base.njk
title: Blog
description: "Expert guides, product reviews, and buying advice. Browse our latest posts."
bodyClass: blog
permalink: /blog/
---

{# AI AGENT: This is the blog index page. It lists all posts from the "posts" collection
   (any .md file in src/blog/ with the "posts" tag, which blog.json adds automatically).

   Customize the hero section and card layout for your niche. Consider adding:
   - Category/tag filtering
   - Featured post at the top
   - Search functionality
   - Pagination for large catalogs (Eleventy supports this natively) #}

<div class="blog-hero">
  <h1>{{ site.name }} Blog</h1>
  <p>Expert advice, product reviews, and guides to help you make the best choices.</p>
</div>

<div class="blog-list">
  {%- for post in collections.posts | reverse -%}
  <article class="blog-card">
    {% if post.data.tags and post.data.tags.length > 1 %}
    <div class="eyebrow">{{ post.data.tags[1] }}</div>
    {% endif %}
    <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
    {% if post.data.description %}
    <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    {% endif %}
    <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="read-more">Read more &rarr;</a>
  </article>
  {%- endfor -%}

  {% if not collections.posts or collections.posts.length == 0 %}
  <div class="store-welcome">
    <h2>Coming Soon</h2>
    <p>We're working on expert guides and product reviews. Check back soon!</p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>
